{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/5f687143a68a041be3a6df7f9a3b2c0b.poster.avif?t=1756738752\" width=780 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/5f687143a68a041be3a6df7f9a3b2c0b.webm?t=1756738752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/5f687143a68a041be3a6df7f9a3b2c0b.mp4?t=1756738752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kamikaze Strike: FPV Drone</i> puts your piloting skills to the test in intense first-person drone missions. Experience smooth, responsive drone controls as you navigate hostile skies from an immersive FPV view. Dodge enemy fire, avoid jammers and radars, and precisely crash into high-value targets like tanks, artillery, and enemy bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master different drones, each with unique flight characteristics and explosive payloads. Upgrade and customize your fleet to fit your playstyle\u2014whether you prefer fast and agile strikes or heavy, powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With realistic flight physics, challenging objectives, and explosive action, <i>Kamikaze Strike</i> delivers an exciting blend of pilot skill and tactical combat for drone and action fans alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.poster.avif?t=1756738752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.webm?t=1756738752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.mp4?t=1756738752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902740?t=1756738752","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/60897a58e4d8f098a5ddc2087472bfc38b19f829/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756738752","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/b24af30bbccc36b91e34f403e9fd15ad3d153b7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756738752","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/b24af30bbccc36b91e34f403e9fd15ad3d153b7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756738752","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/5f687143a68a041be3a6df7f9a3b2c0b.poster.avif?t=1756738752\" width=780 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/5f687143a68a041be3a6df7f9a3b2c0b.webm?t=1756738752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/5f687143a68a041be3a6df7f9a3b2c0b.mp4?t=1756738752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kamikaze Strike: FPV Drone</i> puts your piloting skills to the test in intense first-person drone missions. Experience smooth, responsive drone controls as you navigate hostile skies from an immersive FPV view. Dodge enemy fire, avoid jammers and radars, and precisely crash into high-value targets like tanks, artillery, and enemy bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master different drones, each with unique flight characteristics and explosive payloads. Upgrade and customize your fleet to fit your playstyle\u2014whether you prefer fast and agile strikes or heavy, powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With realistic flight physics, challenging objectives, and explosive action, <i>Kamikaze Strike</i> delivers an exciting blend of pilot skill and tactical combat for drone and action fans alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.poster.avif?t=1756738752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.webm?t=1756738752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.mp4?t=1756738752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Dinomore Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/de4e0e5c5f9166236e9054e6d48fa32cd41045ae/header.jpg?t=1756738752","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257175753,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175753/movie480.mp4?t=1755129451","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25